# launcher-enchants: the saved game the launcher-enchants enhanced session starts from. A new
# character, as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's
# cheats (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a crossbow with the weapon enchantment of
# effect 15 ("of Unsurpassed Damage", 8 damage) and a bow with effect 7 ("of Unsurpassed
# Accuracy", 8 to hit), as a level stores them (give ITEM enchant N), 10 crossbow bolts and 10
# arrows, into the pack; and the player moved to (36, 6) on level 1, facing the locked door at
# (36, 8) (key-ring's), a square back so that a missile has room. Saved in slot I, described "bows"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x01A enchant 15
44100 cheat give 0x019 enchant 7
44200 cheat give 0x011 10
44300 cheat give 0x012 10
44400 cheat goto 1 36 6
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "bows"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key b
50700 key o
50900 key w
51100 key s
52000 key enter
